#join\">OPEN CALL ↗</a>\n  </header>\n</template>\n","<template>\n  <section class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"hero-side\"><span>ZH U ZH O U</span><span>2026 / ISSUE 01</span></div>\n    <div class=\"hero-copy\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">株洲市南方中学 · 学生自主技术社群</p>\n      <h1>信息<br><em>拓展</em>社</h1>\n      <div class=\"hero-foot\"><p>不只使用技术。<br>也把它拆开、重组、交给下一个人。</p><a class=\"round-link\" href=\"#about\">向下看 <span>↓</span></a></div>\n    </div>\n    <aside class=\"hero-poster\" aria-label=\"社团视觉标识\">\n      <div class=\"poster-bars\"><i v-for=\"item in 5\" :key=\"item\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"poster-stamp\">NANFANG<br>INFO<br>EXPANSION</div><div class=\"poster-orbit\">ITEX · ITEX · ITEX · ITEX ·</div><div class=\"poster-mark\">01</div>\n    </aside>\n  </section>\n</template>\n","<script setup lang=\"ts\">\ndefineProps<{ project: { number: string, tag: string, title: string, description: string, tone: string, decoration: string } }>()\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <article class=\"project\" :class=\"project.tone\">\n    <span class=\"number\">{{ project.number }}</span><span class=\"tag\">{{ project.tag }}</span>\n    <h3>{{ project.title }}</h3><p>{{ project.description }}</p><a href=\"#join\">查看方向 <b>→</b></a>\n    <div class=\"project-decoration\" :class=\"`decoration-${project.tone}`\">{{ project.decoration }}</div>\n  </article>\n</template>\n","export const projects = [\n  { number: '01', tag: 'FIELD SUPPORT', title: '班级数字\\n急救箱', description: '把日常维护经验整理成可复用的清单、工具与说明，让“不会用”少一点。', tone: 'yellow', decoration: '✚' },\n  { number: '02', tag: 'BUILD LAB', title: '小工具\\n试验场', description: '从一个不顺手的瞬间开始，用代码、自动化和网页把它变得更好一点。', tone: 'blue', decoration: '</>\\n0010\\n1101' },\n  { number: '03', tag: 'OPEN ARCHIVE', title: '校园创作\\n公开存档', description: '把作品、教程和失败的记录留下来。下一位好奇的人，不必从零开始。', tone: 'red', decoration: 'PUBLIC\\nACCESS' }\n]\n\nexport const principles = [\n  ['01', '先动手，再讨论。', 'BUILD FIRST'],\n  ['02', '分享比独占更酷。', 'SHARE WHAT WORKS'],\n  ['03', '可以提问，也可以说“我不知道”。', 'STAY CURIOUS'],\n  ['04', '尊重规则，也保留创造力。', 'THINK RESPONSIBLY']\n]\n","<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { principles, projects } from '~/data/site'\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div><div class=\"noise\" aria-hidden=\"true\" /><SiteHeader />\n    <main id=\"top\">\n      <HeroPanel />\n      <section id=\"about\" class=\"manifesto\"><p class=\"section-index\">01 / ABOUT</p><h2>让好奇心<br>有地方<span>落地。</span></h2>\n        <div class=\"manifesto-text\"><p>我们是一群在校园里折腾电脑、做小工具、研究网络与创意表达的人。有人会修设备，有人写代码，有人做视觉，也有人只是想弄懂“它为什么这样运作”。</p><p>信息拓展社不是培训班。这里没有标准答案，只有一起把问题变成作品的同伴。</p></div><div class=\"statement\">KEEP IT<br>CURIOUS.</div>\n      </section>\n      <section id=\"work\" class=\"work\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><p class=\"section-index\">02 / ON THE TABLE</p><h2>正在发生<br><span>的事情</span></h2><p class=\"mono-note\">更新于 2026.07<br>每一次尝试都值得记录</p></div><div class=\"project-grid\"><ProjectCard v-for=\"project in projects\" :key=\"project.number\" :project=\"project\" /></div></section>\n      <section class=\"rules\"><p class=\"section-index\">03 / GROUND RULES</p><div class=\"rules-title\"><h2>我们相信<br><span>这些事</span></h2><div>✱</div></div><ol><li v-for=\"rule in principles\" :key=\"rule[0]\"><b>{{ rule[0] }}</b><span>{{ rule[1] }}</span><small>{{ rule[2] }}</small></li></ol></section>\n      <section id=\"join\" class=\"join\"><div class=\"join-label\">04 / OPEN INVITATION</div><div class=\"join-main\"><h2>带着你的<br><em>问题</em>来。</h2><p>不需要履历，不限技能栈。<br>如果你对“怎么让它更好”感到兴奋，我们想认识你。</p><a class=\"big-button\" href=\"mailto:hello@nfix.club?subject=我想加入信息拓展社\">发送一封自我介绍 <span>↗</span></a></div><div class=\"join-side\"><span>南方中学</span><b>ITEx<br>CLUB</b><span>STUDENT RUN / NON-OFFICIAL</span></div></section>\n    </main><SiteFooter />\n  </div>\n</template>\n"],"version":3}